      "message": "build/blueprint/.github/workflows/build.xml had some tests that verify correct incremental build behaviors in blueprint:\n    - run: ./tests/test.sh\n    - run: ./tests/test_tree_tests.sh\n    - run: ./tests/test_tree_tests.sh -t\n\nsoong_build never had tests on its own, we relied on the similarities between minibp and soong_build to assume that soong_build worked.  Since you\u0027re changing how this works I think the testing story needs to change too.",
