      "writtenOn": "2021-03-05T22:52:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The tests in build/blueprint/.github/workflows/build.xml are not Go tests, they are scripts that exercise bootstrapping after making changes to ensure bootstrapping has proper dependencies.  None of those tests apply any more, and I think we need real testing before checking this in.  Remember, this immediately becomes live for all Android engineers, and incorrect behavior during bootstrap could lead to incorrect incremental builds for developers and on the build servers.",
      "parentUuid": "747f59ee_8cbdbb7b",
      "revId": "b7679d96fbd01caaae31d0b18aa9bea6579a6911",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
